{"version":1,"content":"<p>【22：00更新】今日（21日）傍晚6時許，警方接獲《點新聞》職員報案，指於田灣海旁道7號興偉中心3樓辦公室準備拆信時，發現裝有粉末的可疑信件。</p><p>警方爆炸品處理課（EOD）正在場處理及調查。</p><p>據了解，興偉中心3樓全層均為大公文匯及點新聞辦公室。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T15:01:24.349221+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:09:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T08:56:35.407076+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T14:57:41.711501+00:00","content_hash":"7be7172cf8e925241e7a74188ae4ec72967ebdd33f83728619b8805df721751b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}